<style>
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
:root{--pink:#ff2d8e;--pink-deep:#c4006b;--ink:#190512;--cream:#fff3e6;--yellow:#ffd23f;}
body{font-family:'Poppins',Helvetica,sans-serif;background:var(--cream);color:var(--ink);}
.an{font-family:'Anton',Impact,sans-serif;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:.95;}
.hero{background:var(--pink);padding:48px 20px 34px;text-align:center;border-bottom:5px solid var(--ink);}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(38px,9vw,72px);color:#fff;text-shadow:4px 4px 0 var(--ink);}
.hero p{color:#fff;font-weight:600;margin-top:12px;max-width:640px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;}
.eyebrow{display:inline-block;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:999px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:16px;border:2px solid #fff;box-shadow:3px 3px 0 var(--yellow);}
.wrap{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px 16px 48px;}
.wrap h2{font-size:26px;margin:6px 0 14px;}
.lede{font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:18px;}
ul.list{list-style:none;}
.ev{margin-bottom:12px;}
.ev a{display:block;background:#fff;border:3px solid var(--ink);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 16px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);box-shadow:4px 4px 0 var(--pink);}
.ev a:hover{transform:translate(-1px,-1px);box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--pink);}
.dt{display:block;font-weight:800;color:var(--pink-deep);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;}
.ci{display:block;font-family:'Anton',Impact,sans-serif;font-size:26px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:2px 0 4px;}
.wh{display:block;font-size:13px;color:#4b3340;}
.faq{margin-top:34px;}
.faq h3{font-size:16px;margin:16px 0 6px;}
.faq p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;}
footer{text-align:center;padding:26px 20px;font-size:12px;color:#fff;background:var(--ink);font-weight:600;}
footer a{color:var(--yellow);}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<section class="hero">
  <span class="eyebrow">★ {{COUNT}} upcoming stops · Free entry ★</span>
  <h1 class="an">Makeup Blowout Sale<br>Upcoming Events</h1>
  <p>A 3-day pop-up beauty sale. Friday–Sunday {{HOURS_SHORT}}. Up to 75% off 40+ prestige makeup, skincare, haircare &amp; fragrance brands. Free entry, free parking, no tickets needed.</p>
</section>
<main class="wrap">
  <h2 class="an">Find your city</h2>
  <p class="lede">Every stop on the tour, in date order. Tap a city for the venue address, hours and the free-gift sign-up.</p>
  <ul class="list">
{{ROWS}}
  </ul>
  <section class="faq">
    <h3>What is the Makeup Blowout Sale?</h3>
    <p>A travelling weekend pop-up where prestige makeup, skincare, haircare and fragrance brands are sold at up to 75% off retail. It runs Friday to Sunday, {{HOURS_SHORT}}, usually in a hotel ballroom or event hall, and has been touring the US for ten years.</p>
    <h3>Is there an entry fee or a ticket?</h3>
    <p>No. Entry and parking are free and no ticket is needed. Signing up by text before you come gets you a free eyeshadow at the door.</p>
    <h3>What should I bring?</h3>
    <p>Just yourself. Come early on Friday for the widest selection.</p>
  </section>
</main>
<footer>THE MAKEUP BLOWOUT SALE · 10 YEARS · <a href="https://themakeupblowout.com/">themakeupblowout.com</a><br>Updated {{UPDATED}} · &copy; The Makeup Blowout Sale Group</footer>
</body>
